<h6 style="text-align:left;" data-zesty-id="content:text:2:42">Partner &amp; sponsor opportunities</h6>
<h5 style="text-align:left;" data-zesty-id="content:text:3:47"><span style="color:#ed1c2b;">Doing the Most Good is Best When it's Shared.</span></h5>
<p style="text-align:left;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:4:15"> <br><strong><span style="color:#999999;"><em>(Updated April 2026)</em></span></strong></p>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:5:38"></div>
<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:6:77"><h5>Together, We Can Do the <span style="color:#ed1c2b;">Most Good</span></h5>

<p>
	We are excited to offer exclusive partnership and sponsorship opportunities for businesses and organizations looking to make a meaningful impact.
</p>

<p>
	By aligning with us, you can showcase your brand to a diverse and engaged audience while supporting <strong>The Salvation Army's mission of Doing The Most Good.</strong>
</p>

<p>
	As a partner or sponsor, you’ll gain visibility and recognition through a range of branding opportunities, including logo placement, media exposure, event signage and customized activations. Whether you're looking to increase brand awareness, connect with potential customers or demonstrate your commitment to helping those in need, our annual or event-specific packages ensure maximum exposure and meaningful engagement.
</p>

<p>
	Join us in creating a lasting impression and making a difference. Together, we can achieve great things!
</p>

<p>
	View our <a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/f05b863d-a268-47c2-92ea-a07d659b369a_Sig+Events+Updated+Aug+2025.pdf">Signature Events&nbsp;Flyer</a>.
</p>

